  "has_quantitative_results": true,
  "summary": "The paper proposes a hybrid ensemble for S&P 500 directional prediction combining classical models with a 4‑qubit variational quantum circuit used as a sentiment feature extractor. The Top‑7 architecture‑diverse ensemble achieves 60.14% directional accuracy on 286 out‑of‑sample predictions (2020–2023), improving over the best individual model at 57.04%, while quantum features contribute an average +1.09% improvement per model and +0.82% to the ensemble.",
